<!--
  The GtradeA mark, as the notification small icon.

  The three path definitions below are the ones in assets/brand/logo.svg, which
  are themselves byte for byte the storefront's own icon.svg. Nothing has been
  redrawn or reproportioned. Two things differ, and both are Android's rules
  rather than a design decision.

  First, every fill is white. Android renders a notification small icon as an
  alpha mask from API 21 on: the colour channels are thrown away and anything
  not transparent is painted in one colour chosen by the system, which this app
  now sets to Trust Blue. Keeping the orange and teal here would not produce an
  orange and teal icon. It would produce exactly the same silhouette, while
  implying this file controls a colour it does not.

  Second, the group translates the mark back to the origin. The SVG's viewBox
  starts at (36.6, 36.2) because it is cropped to the mark's own bounds, and an
  Android viewport always starts at (0, 0). The offset moves onto the group so
  the path data itself stays untouched.

  This replaces the reference to @mipmap/ic_launcher, which on this project is
  still the stock Flutter logo that `flutter create` writes. Flattened by the
  alpha mask it arrived as a white blob of somebody else's shape, tinted by
  whatever accent the device happened to pick. That was the random colour and
  logo.

  Note for anyone editing this comment: XML forbids a doubled hyphen inside a
  comment, and using one here failed the resource parser before the build ever
  reached the paths below.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="24dp"
    android:height="24dp"
    android:viewportWidth="173.6"
    android:viewportHeight="158.7">
    <group
        android:translateX="-36.6"
        android:translateY="-36.2">
        <path
            android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
            android:pathData="M169.34,126.56v43.61c-13.86,14.04-33,22.72-54.15,22.72-17.96,0-34.47-6.27-47.53-16.76,2.02.17,4.08.26,6.15.26,32.3,0,59.9-20.67,70.89-49.83h24.64Z" />
        <path
            android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
            android:pathData="M208.22,93.95L208.22,192.69L169.34,192.69L169.34,126.56L104.52,126.56L128.57,94L128.6,93.95Z" />
        <path
            android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
            android:pathData="M169.48,38.16v.45l-10.32,13.98-10.57,14.3-20.02,27.11c-40.36,1.22-72.79,31.59-73.62,69.18-10.22-13.15-16.3-29.73-16.3-47.75,0-40.15,30.19-73.15,68.83-76.89,2.41-.25,4.87-.37,7.36-.37h54.65Z" />
    </group>
</vector>
